#. な、苗木…
#. ちょっと、あたしの部屋まで来てくれる？
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hey, M-Makoto? Could you come to my room...?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. あんたに…見せたい物があるの…
#. ま、待ってる…わよ…
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I want to sh-show you something. I'll be waiting\n"
"th-there..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしたんだ腐川さん…
#. 急にボクを呼び出したりして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's not like her, to just talk to someone so openly\n"
"like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、腐川さんの部屋になんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And she wants me to come to her room...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. とりあえず…行ってみるか…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, I'd better do what she asked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんに言われた通り、
#. ボクはすぐに彼女の部屋へと向かった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I quickly made my way to Toko's room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よ、よく来たわね…
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Th-Thanks for coming..."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも勘違いしないでよ…！
#. あたしは…そういうアレで呼び出した訳じゃないから！
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"But don't get the wrong i-idea! I didn't ask you here\n"
"for a-anything...like that!"
msgstr ""

#. 押し倒したりしたら…
#. 舌噛んで…死んでやるわよ…！
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If you lay a hand on me, I'll b-bite my own tongue off\n"
"and choke o-on the blood! Till I'm d-dead!"
msgstr ""

#. その心配はないよ…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Trust me, that's not gonna happen..."
msgstr ""

#. それより、どうしたの？
#. ボクに見せたい物って？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, what's going on? You said you had something\n"
"you wanted to show me?"
msgstr ""

#. これよ…
#. これを見てもらいたかったのよ…
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I was hoping you would...r-read this."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、腐川さんはボクに、
#. 分厚い紙の束を手渡した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Toko handed me a massive stack of thick paper.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには、腐川さんの手書きの文字が
#. びっしりと並んでいた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I saw handwriting on the top sheet, the neat letters\n"
"packed close together.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. もしかして、これって…
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is this...?"
msgstr ""

#. あんたに言われたように書いてみたわ…
#. まずは…読んでみて…
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I took your advice and s-started writing. I wanted you\n"
"to be th-the first one to read it..."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-Thanks..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは言われるままに、
#. 文字の上に視線を滑らせていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I started scanning the text.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ものの数秒で止まらなくなった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A few seconds later, I was still reading...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>次々と言葉が頭の中に流れ込み、
#. そして、景色として目の前に広がっていく！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The words kept flowing into my head, the scenery\n"
"unfolding before my very eyes...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お、面白い…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's good..."
msgstr ""

#. 面白いよ、腐川さん！
#. こんな面白い小説なんて初めてだよ！
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"This is really good, Toko! I dunno if I've ever read\n"
"anything this good!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうでしょう？
#. うふ…うふふ…！
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "It's pretty g-good, right? Hehehe...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>暗い！　すごく暗い！
#. 読むのが辛くなる位に暗いぞ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's really dark! Super dark! Reading it kinda makes\n"
"me wanna die!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そういう小説…なんて呼ぶか知っている？
#. 作者が直接経験した事を…題材に書かれた小説…
msgctxt "0027 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You know what they c-call the type of writing where the\n"
"author has directly experienced the subject matter?"
msgstr ""

#. 日本における自然主義文学…
#. 田山花袋の蒲団なんかがその始まりであるとされる…
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It's a kind of naturalistic style popular in Japan.\n"
"Katai Tayama's \"Futon\" started it all..."
msgstr ""

#. 私小説
msgctxt "0029 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "I-Novel"
msgstr ""

#. 教養小説
msgctxt "0030 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Bildungsroman"
msgstr ""

#. 教養小説だったかな？
#. そんなのを授業で習ったけど…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Isn't that called a Bildungsroman? I think I learned\n"
"that in school."
msgstr ""

#. 違うわよ…
msgctxt "0032 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "T-Totally wrong..."
msgstr ""

#. 教養小説っていうのは…
#. 主人公の自己形成の過程に重きを置いた小説よ…
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"A Bildungsroman places an emphasis on the protagonist's\n"
"process of self-formation and self-discovery."
msgstr ""

#. ゲーテのウィルヘルム＝マイスター…
#. ヘッセの車輪の下が有名ね…
msgctxt "0034 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"For example, Herman Hesse's \"Beneath the Wheel\" or\n"
"Goethe's \"Wilhelm Meister's Apprenticeship.\""
msgstr ""

#. へえ、そうなんだ…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oooh...I see!"
msgstr ""

#. 授業でならった事を丸暗記してるだけ…
#. 苗木らしいわね…
msgctxt "0036 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Did you j-just sit in class, memorizing the w-words,\n"
"but with no idea what they meant? I b-bet you did..."
msgstr ""

#. う…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Gh..."
msgstr ""

#. この小説のジャンルも
#. 授業で習ってるはずだけど…？
msgctxt "0038 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"But I'm sure you l-learned about that other t-type of\n"
"novel..."
msgstr ""

#. わからないな…
msgctxt "0039 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "I-Don't-Know"
msgstr ""

#. うーん、わからないな…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hmmm... I'm pretty sure the answer is \"I don't know.\""
msgstr ""

#. でしょうね…
msgctxt "0041 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Why am I n-not surprised?"
msgstr ""

#. きっと…マンガとかラノベしか
#. 読んでないんでしょうし…
msgctxt "0042 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I bet you don't read anything b-but comics and books\n"
"for k-kids..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんなことないよ…
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-That's not true...!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、答えてみなさいよ…
#. ヒントはこれ以上、あげないけど…
msgctxt "0044 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Fine, then tell me the a-answer. And no hints...!"
msgstr ""

#. わからないの…？
msgctxt "0045 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Do you r-really not know?"
msgstr ""

#. 作者が直接経験した事…
#. つまり、私事について綴られているのよ…
msgctxt "0046 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It d-deals with the authors personal experiences. It\n"
"lets them explore th-the issues they're dealing with."
msgstr ""

#. こう言えば…苗木でもわかるんじゃない…？
msgctxt "0047 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I can't possible make i-it any more clear than that..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>作者が直接経験した事を題材に書かれた小説…
#. それって…国語の授業とかで習った事があるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Novels that use the author's own experiences... I'm\n"
"pretty sure I learned about that at some point...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私小説…だったよね？
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you talking about an I-Novel?"
msgstr ""

#. えぇ…その通りよ…
msgctxt "0050 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "C-Correct...!"
msgstr ""

#. あたしの小説はまだ途中だけど…
#. それが完成されれば…
msgctxt "0051 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Mine's still a w-work in progress, though. But as soon\n"
"a-as it's finished..."
msgstr ""

#. 私小説の歴史を変える<CLT 3>衝撃的名作<CLT>になる！
#. それは間違いないわ！！
msgctxt "0052 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"...it's going to b-become a <CLT 3>shocking masterpiece<CLT>\n"
"that'll change the face of the I-Novel f-forever!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、それも…
#. あながち間違ってないかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing her...she might actually be right about\n"
"that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、こんなに暗くて重いのに、
#. 読み進めてしまう面白さがあるなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's definitely some dark, heavy stuff. But it's the\n"
"kind of thing you just can't put down.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 名作だよ…間違いなく名作だよ。
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It *will* be a masterpiece, I have no doubt about\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、あんたのお陰よ…
msgctxt "0056 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "And it's all th-thanks to you, Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. あんたのお陰で…あたしは…
msgctxt "0057 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Thanks to you, I-I..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0058 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. だ、駄目だわ…恥ずかしい…
msgctxt "0059 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Ahh, I'm s-so embarrassed...!"
msgstr ""

#. その感謝の意は…<CLT 3>詩<CLT>を通して伝えるわね…
msgctxt "0060 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'll express my a-appreciation in the form of a\n"
"<CLT 3>p-poem<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 詩を…通して…？
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A poem...?"
msgstr ""

#. 閉ざされた錆付いた扉に…
#. あたしは激しく爪を立てている…
msgctxt "0062 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"On a locked and rusted door / I dug my nails in and\n"
"dragged them down /"
msgstr ""

#. 割れた爪から流れる生温かい血が、
#. 手首に…あたしの体に…蛇のように絡みつく…
msgctxt "0063 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Warm blood mixed with old rust / Flowing down my wrist\n"
"/ Coils like a snake / Embracing my body /"
msgstr ""

#. あなたはそれを見ている。
#. 笑いながら見ている。
msgctxt "0064 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You watch me / A smile in your eyes / You watch /"
msgstr ""

#. やがて、あなたは逃げて行く…
#. 赤い血の海に寝そべるあたしだけを残して…
msgctxt "0065 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Time runs away / And you with it / You leave me\n"
"drowning in a red sea /"
msgstr ""

#. …伝わったでしょ？　今のがあたしの気持ちよ。
msgctxt "0066 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...Well? Now do you understand how I feel?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、まったく伝わらないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>God I hope not...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、腐川さんがいいなら、
#. それでいいか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But if it makes her happy, that's all that matters.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな気持ちになるのって、
#. 少しは腐川さんの事がわかってきたからなのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Can I say that because I've finally started to\n"
"understand her, even if only a little bit...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ところで…もう話は終わったのよ…
msgctxt "0070 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "S-So...that's it for now."
msgstr ""

#. それに…あんたのお陰でやる気になって…
#. だから…早く続きを書きたいのよ…
msgctxt "0071 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You've helped me find m-my motivation. Now I have to\n"
"do my b-best to bring the story to an end."
msgstr ""

#. あたしが…やる気になってるんだから…
#. そ、それを応援するのが…
msgctxt "0072 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"And when there's someone there t-to support me for\n"
"that..."
msgstr ""

#. な、<CLT 3>仲間<CLT>…なんでしょ…？
msgctxt "0073 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...that's what you c-call a <CLT 3>friend<CLT>...right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>仲間<CLT><CLT 4>…腐川さんがその言葉を使うって事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>Friend<CLT><CLT 4>... I never imagined I'd hear Toko say that\n"
"word.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ようやく腐川さんとも<CLT 3>仲間になれた<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. そういう事なのかもしれない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But yes...Toko and I had <CLT 3>finally become true\n"
"friends<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ほら…！　さっさと出て行きなさいよ…！
#. あ、あたしを押し倒す前に出て行きなさいよ…！
msgctxt "0076 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Now get out b-before you decide to lunge for m-me\n"
"after all!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>腐川冬子の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Toko's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんの部屋を追い出された後、
#. ボクは、自分の部屋へ戻る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Toko kicked me out of her room, so I headed back to my\n"
"own.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
